  "reason": "Existing evidence shows RNA-only models with scvi_n200 encoder and multiprofile data achieve high accuracy (0.653). Image-only models underperform (0.208). The next experiment should test combining the best RNA encoder (scvi_n200) with a stronger image encoder (imagenet_vit_l) using transformer aggregation (which slightly outperformed avgpool in RNA-only). This isolates the effect of multimodal integration and advanced image encoders, addressing critical uncertainty about whether multimodal approaches can surpass RNA-only performance."
